# The historical form of the beta stop rule: same-day ties and no upper bound
# on `taken-day`, like the band's historical rules.

rule fixture.beta-low v0.1
says "The holder's most recent beta reading in the last 365 days is below 300."

subject holder

collection readings : reading for subject via holder

conclude BetaLow when
  some reading e in readings
  require e.test-code = beta
  require e.amount < 300
  require e.taken-day >= as-of-day - 365
  none of
    some reading n in readings
    require n.test-code = beta
    require n.taken-day > e.taken-day
